 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, determine the most reasonable value for each area.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 526581,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "bedroom wall: 12 km<sup>2</sup>, 12 m<sup>2</sup>, 12 cm<sup>2</sup>, or 12 mm<sup>2</sup>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A kilometer is a little farther than half a mile. Square kilometers are not practical for measuring walls.</p>\n<p>Square centimeters are around the size of your fingerprint. This is too small for measuring your wall. Square millimeters are even smaller.</p>\n<p>A meter is roughly the length of a yardstick. 12 square meters is a good measure for your wall.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "12 m<sup>2</sup>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 526582,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "city park: 1,200 km<sup>2</sup>, 1,200 m<sup>2</sup>, 1,200 cm<sup>2</sup>, or 1,200 mm<sup>2</sup>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Square centimeters are around the size of your fingerprint. This is too small for measuring your park. Square millimeters are even smaller.</p>\n<p>A meter is roughly the length of a yardstick. 1,200 square meters would be good for a city park.</p>\n<p>A kilometer is a little farther than half a mile. 1,200 square kilometers is too large for a city park.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "1,200 m<sup>2</sup>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 526583,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "kitchen table: 2.5 km<sup>2</sup>, 2.5 m<sup>2</sup>, 2.5 cm<sup>2</sup>, or 2.5 mm<sup>2</sup>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Square centimeters are around the size of your fingerprint. This is too small for measuring your table. Square millimeters are even smaller.</p>\n<p>A meter is roughly the length of a yardstick. 2.5 square meters would be good for a table.</p>\n<p>A kilometer is a little farther than half a mile. 2.5 square kilometers is far too large for a table.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "2.5 m<sup>2</sup>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
